{"id": "unknown-2026-10-11-011", "date": "2026-10-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["record"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "As electric semi truck race heats up, SoCal is getting another charging hub", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/EV-Realty.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As record-breaking diesel prices drive demand for electric big rigs, so, too is the demand for commercial truck charging climbing. To meet that demand, EV Realty as announced a new, Inland Empire site for its next electric semi truck charging hub.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"commercia", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/10/11/as-electric-semi-truck-race-heats-up-socal-is-getting-another-charging-hub/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-11-012", "date": "2026-10-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "459 hp, 0-60 in 3.9 sec, and AWD – meet Mitsubishi’s new-age electric EVO [video]", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/mitsubishi_asx_vre.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mitusbishi’s North American dealers have been trudging along with an aging, badge-engineered model line for years – but overseas? It’s a different story, and the 459 hp all-wheel drive ASX VR-e electric hot hatch shown here is plug-in proof.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"foxcon", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/10/11/459-hp-0-60-in-3-9-sec-and-awd-meet-mitsubishis-new-age-electric-evo-video/", "type": "rss"}]}
